token-weather
  hooks/weather.ts follows token-weather by Anthropic (Claude Code DevRel),
  from https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code-playground
  (claude-code/mods/token-weather), licensed under the Apache License 2.0;
  a copy is in LICENSE-APACHE. The forecast bands, icons and turn chart come
  from it. Changed here: folded into the line under Clawd, with the 5-hour and
  weekly usage limits added. The upstream project ships no NOTICE file.

context-lens
  The context view in hooks/lens.ts is modeled on context-lens by Arunjay4213,
